  The editor colour schemes (Solarized, Nord, Dracula, Gruvbox, One Dark) are
  re-expressed in Kodelab's own CodeScheme type from each project's published,
  MIT-licensed colour values. No theme file from another editor is bundled or
  redistributed; users can import standard theme JSON at runtime into
  .kodelab/themes/.

